graph TD
    A([Başlangıç]) --> B[EventType enum tanımlanır: 8 varyant]
    B --> C[OwnedEvent struct: symbol [u8;16] + payload EventType]

    C --> D[pack_symbol: sym -> [u8;16], 16 karaktere kırp]
    D --> E[new_trade: pack_symbol + EventType::Trade kur]

    E --> F[new_orderbook: pack_symbol + Orderbook kur]
    E --> G[new_liquidation: pack_symbol + Liquidation kur]
    E --> H[new_funding_rate: pack_symbol + FundingRate kur]
    E --> I[new_bookticker: pack_symbol + BookTicker kur]
    E --> J[new_open_interest: pack_symbol + OpenInterest kur]
    E --> K[new_opportunity: pack_symbol + Opportunity kur]
    E --> L[new_symbol_metrics: pack_symbol + SymbolMetrics kur]

    F --> M[OwnedEvent döndür]
    G --> M
    H --> M
    I --> M
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M

    C --> N[Debug impl: EventType ve OwnedEvent debug_struct ile formatlanır]
    M --> Z([Bitiş])
    N --> Z([Bitiş])
